#<_twp_s1_b_residual> = #<_twp_s1_measure_residual>
(Probe results have G5X and the canonical tool offset removed by emccanon.)
(Restore both, remove the captured local coordinate layer, then transform.)
#<local_dx> = [#<_twp_s1_b_local_x> + #<_twp_s1_wcs_x> - #<_twp_s1_offset_x>]
#<local_dy> = [#<_twp_s1_b_local_y> + #<_twp_s1_wcs_y> - #<_twp_s1_offset_y>]
